  "result": "`slugify` is added to `src/cli/slug.ts`, with tests in `test/cli/slug.test.ts`, and the work is committed. `npm run fast` passes. I did not run the full `npm run gate`.\n\n- **Behaviour:** it strips accents, lowercases, and joins words with single hyphens. Any run of non-letter, non-digit characters counts as a separator, so leading and trailing hyphens are trimmed. Input with no words returns an empty string.\n- **Tests:** four cases cover case folding, accents, repeated separators with trimming, and empty or punctuation-only input.\n- **Extra change:** a rules test requires every test file to have a shard weight, so I added `'test/cli/slug.test.ts': 0.1` to `scripts/lib/shard-weights.mjs`. I guessed the 0.1 from the weights of similar small tests, not from CI measurements.\n- **Notes:** the plan and status are in `NOTES-slugify.md` at the repository root, and I updated it as I went.",
